  "display_fullname": "Redirects Sonic Melee Attune",
  "display_help": "You focus high-intensity sound waves that match the resonant frequency of your targets with your <color #fcfc95>single target</color> Sonic Melee attacks. This power inflicts continuous damage over time as well as reducing the target's resistances to Damage and Debuffs. You can only Attune to a target for a brief time, needing constant tuning to maintain.<br><br>While Attune is active, all your other Sonic Melee attacks will also gain 10% more potency, enhancing their effects vs enemies.",
